## Hints

- G1: precision ratio = 1.96·SE/|effect| = 1.96/t — the CI width
  relative to the effect depends only on t, not on n. (t = 2.4 →
  band ≈ 82% of the effect; t = 3.2 → 61%.)
- G2: detectable = 2.8 × SE. "Minimum tradable" asks the same
  question with t = 2.0 and power 0.8: 2.8·SE again — the line is
  the line.
- G3: two-sided p at large n: 2·(1−Φ(|t|)). The m=300 row is the
  HLZ arithmetic; watch momentum's 0.03 become 0.4.
